{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_011_03_f",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:4246d48205b4aa8745c5feb48fb335b7fc14c430a56944412377b374ef336f64",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_f:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2cc5d545823d54ed61afd37ac1274fda6f0cd8c702e22b4be95bada3990fc7ea",
      "text": "另外，花音君作为模特的工作表现，\n以及极高的专业素养也非常出色……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_f:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7d32bc7c63ddd0ae1d895001635ab0bec4b9f474766280988a8d3b6fea5936e5",
      "text": "业界甚至传闻，你对待工作的态度\n在同龄人中可以说是拔尖的呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_f:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ba98996d030a117b50ad5e5b804166093a5869cd62369b1647876b2275973096",
      "text": "噢……！您居然对花音有\n这么高的评价吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_f:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:47e413c09051226f54fa17bcbe890f70a734435acc1f407a403ba3c2555447fd",
      "text": "是的，确实如此！前几天也是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_f:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e13c8333c1aef4e301c9f820cbf03cff208ff7133dd112cdadc26cc0a4f0b8f",
      "text": "（制作人，把花音的工作\n夸得好厉害！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_f:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1e34291cbdaff930f293570ac165f190ca75a3dd479cb1f0eab9f021ec67b6c2",
      "text": "（但是，要是花音长大了呢？\n也许就不会再夸花音了……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_f:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c29bf87a43814887a418c5d1216207c994efe419f438f622bd8972ca568f4b1",
      "text": "……所以，如果你有一点兴趣的话，\n请务必来参加试镜。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_f:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f5bb17d955d2d2b243232c22845cce101d4f7a08b74816cfd15d856e78398339",
      "text": "……可是花音长大了之后，\n就穿不了可爱的衣服了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_f:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7cea2621ca95f5ba9bb86f5fcacdbc6fed17f0c2cefd13630af2449b7f7e50b4",
      "text": "没有那种事。\n如果是花音君的话，什么样的演出服都能驾驭的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_f:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eea0b83011703c045ec42f792c94ef0862a50d48f70fd24288274f647be18005",
      "text": "演出服？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_f:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9974dd2b823d85a7b17a8b5db64117c9e2522b49906a7ead8414012a67fad67a",
      "text": "（啊，对哦！偶像是会在电视节目什么的里面\n穿各种各样可爱的衣服的！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_f:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8583bc95d89005f6004aa7dffb5d72ef4ef0a1247b448fe44a2521b4e22c248b",
      "text": "（闪闪发光又毛茸茸的可爱演出服……\n花音也想穿穿看呀……）",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
